message: "If you use this research, please cite it."
title: "Gender Gaps in Employment: A Comparative Analysis of Foreign-Born and Overall Working-Age Populations in Six European Countries, 2016–2025"
authors:
  - family-names: "John-Inieke"
    given-names: "Enoh"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-2328-8796"
type: dataset
abstract: >
  Independent quantitative research examining gender differences
  in employment and unemployment among foreign-born and overall
  working-age populations across six European countries.
  The analysis uses secondary statistical data from Eurostat
  covering 2016–2025.
repository-code: "https://github.com/EnohInieke/european-gender-employment-analysis"
